ential migration.'=>'Alat operasional termasuk enkripsi keamanan dan migrasi kredensial.','Configure store options that do not belong in the main setup tabs.'=>'Konfigurasikan opsi toko yang tidak termasuk dalam tab pengaturan utama.','Configure plugin branding, menu labels and white-label documentation links.'=>'Konfigurasikan merek plugin, label menu, dan tautan dokumentasi white-label.','Store'=>'Toko','Communication & Tools'=>'Komunikasi & Alat','More'=>'Lainnya','ActiveCampaign'=>'ActiveCampaign','Sync customers and purchases to ActiveCampaign.'=>'Sinkronkan pelanggan dan pembelian ke ActiveCampaign.','Mailchimp'=>'Mailchimp','Add customers to Mailchimp audiences and automate emails.'=>'Tambahkan pelanggan ke audiens Mailchimp dan otomatisasi email.','Kit'=>'Kit','Send customers and purchases to Kit forms and tags.'=>'Kirim pelanggan dan pembelian ke formulir dan tag Kit.','MemberVault'=>'MemberVault','Protect content and manage members with MemberVault.'=>'Lindungi konten dan kelola anggota dengan MemberVault.','SendFox'=>'SendFox','Grow your audience and send automated emails with SendFox.'=>'Kembangkan audiens Anda dan kirim email otomatis dengan SendFox.','Facebook Ad Events'=>'Acara Iklan Facebook','Send Cart events to an existing Meta Pixel or enter a Pixel ID to load it on checkout and paid confirmation pages.'=>'Kirim acara Keranjang ke instalasi Meta Pixel yang ada atau masukkan ID Pixel untuk memuatnya di halaman checkout dan konfirmasi pembayaran.','Google Analytics'=>'Google Analytics','Send Cart events to an existing Google Analytics or Google Tag Manager installation. PublishPress Cart does not install or connect the analytics script.'=>'Kirim acara Keranjang ke instalasi Google Analytics atau Google Tag Manager yang ada. PublishPress Cart tidak menginstal atau menghubungkan skrip analitik.','Google reCAPTCHA'=>'Google reCAPTCHA','Protect checkout forms from spam and bot submissions.'=>'Lindungi formulir checkout dari spam dan pengiriman bot.','Google reCAPTCHA v2'=>'Google reCAPTCHA v2','Configure checkbox or invisible reCAPTCHA v2 protection.'=>'Konfigurasi perlindungan reCAPTCHA v2 dengan kotak centang atau tidak terlihat.','Google reCAPTCHA v3'=>'Google reCAPTCHA v3','Configure score-based reCAPTCHA v3 protection.'=>'Konfigurasi perlindungan reCAPTCHA v3 berbasis skor.','Drip'=>'Drip','Sync customers, tags and ecommerce activity to Drip.'=>'Sinkronkan pelanggan, tag, dan aktivitas ecommerce ke Drip.','Flodesk'=>'Flodesk','Add customers to Flodesk segments.'=>'Tambahkan pelanggan ke segmen Flodesk.','MailerLite'=>'MailerLite','Add customers to MailerLite subscribers and groups.'=>'Tambahkan pelanggan ke dalam langganan dan grup MailerLite.','MailPoet'=>'MailPoet','Add customers to MailPoet lists.'=>'Tambahkan pelanggan ke dalam daftar MailPoet.','Encharge'=>'Encharge','Track order events and sync customers to Encharge.'=>'Lacak peristiwa pesanan dan sinkronkan pelanggan ke Encharge.','FluentCRM'=>'FluentCRM','Add customers to FluentCRM lists and tags.'=>'Tambahkan pelanggan ke dalam daftar dan tag FluentCRM.','Academy LMS'=>'Academy LMS','Enroll or remove students from Academy LMS courses.'=>'Daftarkan atau hapus siswa dari kursus Academy LMS.','Gurucan'=>'Gurucan','Add or remove customers in Gurucan products.'=>'Tambahkan atau hapus pelanggan dalam produk Gurucan.','Heartbeat'=>'Detak Jantung','Manage community access in Heartbeat.'=>'Kelola akses komunitas di Detak Jantung.','Kajabi'=>'Kajabi','Enable Kajabi purchase automations.'=>'Aktifkan otomatisasi pembelian Kajabi.','Teachable'=>'Teachable','Enroll customers into Teachable schools and products.'=>'Daftarkan pelanggan ke sekolah dan produk Teachable.','Upcoach'=>'Upcoach','Grant customers access to Upcoach programs.'=>'Beri pelanggan akses ke program Upcoach.','Tutor LMS'=>'Tutor LMS','Enroll or remove students from Tutor LMS courses.'=>'Daftarkan atau hapus siswa dari kursus Tutor LMS.','LearnDash'=>'LearnDash','Grant or revoke LearnDash course access.'=>'Beri atau cabut akses kursus LearnDash.','WP Courseware'=>'WP Courseware','Manage WP Courseware enrollments after purchase.'=>'Kelola pendaftaran WP Courseware setelah pembelian.','MasterStudy LMS'=>'MasterStudy LMS','Enroll customers into MasterStudy LMS courses.'=>'Daftarkan pelanggan ke kursus MasterStudy LMS.','Groups'=>'Grup','Add or remove customers from WordPress Groups.'=>'Tambahkan atau hapus pelanggan dari Grup WordPress.','MemberPress'=>'MemberPress','Grant customers MemberPress membership access.'=>'Beri pelanggan akses ke keanggotaan MemberPress.','ARMember'=>'ARMember','Grant customers ARMember plan access.'=>'Beri akses rencana ARMember kepada pelanggan.','WishList Member'=>'WishList Member','Grant customers WishList Member level access.'=>'Beri akses level WishList Member kepada pelanggan.','Restrict Content Pro'=>'Restrict Content Pro','Grant customers Restrict Content Pro access.'=>'Beri akses Restrict Content Pro kepada pelanggan.','Ultimate Member'=>'Ultimate Member','Send Ultimate Member welcome emails for new customers.'=>'Kirim email selamat datang Ultimate Member untuk pelanggan baru.','Elementor'=>'Elementor','Choose Elementor templates for checkout components.'=>'Pilih template Elementor untuk komponen checkout.','Divi'=>'Divi','Use PublishPress Cart order forms inside Divi layouts.'=>'Gunakan formulir pesanan PublishPress Cart di dalam tata letak Divi.','Oxygen Builder'=>'Oxygen Builder','Use PublishPress Cart conditions in Oxygen Builder.'=>'Gunakan kondisi PublishPress Cart di Oxygen Builder.','Gutenberg'=>'Gutenberg','Use PublishPress Cart blocks in the WordPress block editor.'=>'Gunakan blok PublishPress Cart di editor blok WordPress.','WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce','Connect PublishPress Cart products with WooCommerce flows.'=>'Hubungkan produk PublishPress Cart dengan alur WooCommerce.','WP Domain Checker'=>'WP Domain Checker','Sell domains through WP Domain Checker checkout flows.'=>'Jual domain melalui alur checkout WP Domain