ers'=>'Diperlukan. Maksimal 22 karakter, tanpa karakter khusus','Update subscription payment status in webhook only'=>'Perbarui status pembayaran langganan hanya di webhook','Enable Sandbox'=>'Aktifkan Sandbox','Yes'=>'Ya','No'=>'Tidak','Verify SSL certificates'=>'Verifikasi sertifikat SSL','Verifies PayPal TLS certificates and hostname matches for server-side PayPal API requests.'=>'Verifikasi sertifikat TLS PayPal dan kecocokan hostname untuk permintaan API PayPal sisi server.','PayPal Email'=>'Email PayPal','Client ID'=>'ID Klien','Secret'=>'Rahasia','PDT Token'=>'Token PDT','Sandbox Email'=>'Email Sandbox','Sandbox Client ID'=>'ID Klien Sandbox','Sandbox Secret'=>'Rahasia Sandbox','Sandbox PDT Token'=>'Token PDT Sandbox','Enable Tax'=>'Aktifkan Pajak','Price Entered'=>'Harga yang Dimasukkan','Show Price'=>'Tampilkan Harga','Enable VAT'=>'Aktifkan PPN','Merchant VAT Country'=>'Negara PPN Merchant','Tax all EU Businesses'=>'Pajak semua Bisnis UE','Disable VAT VIES database lookup'=>'Nonaktifkan pencarian database VIES PPN','Reverse Charge Description'=>'Deskripsi Biaya Balik','VAT Reversal'=>'Pembalikan PPN','Reconnect with Stripe'=>'Sambungkan kembali dengan Stripe','Connect with Stripe'=>'Sambungkan dengan Stripe','Connect server not configured'=>'Server koneksi tidak dikonfigurasi','Set PPCART_STRIPE_CONNECT_SERVER_URL to your PublishPress intermediary URL.'=>'Atur PPCART_STRIPE_CONNECT_SERVER_URL ke URL perantara PublishPress Anda.','1. Connect your Stripe account'=>'1. Hubungkan akun Stripe Anda','We sync your API keys automatically, then walk you through the webhook.'=>'Kami menyinkronkan kunci API Anda secara otomatis, lalu membimbing Anda melalui webhook.','Your saved keys are not direct Stripe keys, so reconnect before you continue.'=>'Kunci yang Anda simpan bukan kunci Stripe langsung, jadi sambungkan kembali sebelum Anda melanjutkan.','Stripe checkout is disabled. You can still connect now.'=>'Checkout Stripe dinonaktifkan. Anda masih dapat terhubung se